  "d.1dlvg7e": "FAITA ÑAN LAIT",
  "d.1dlyq4f": "420 km ya kil ñan sai ñan ebon, tri mineit mua ñan sanrais ñan orbit. Ashgrove Station, eng debri ñan wan brek-ap ae e ol, ma lait ñan Yurop e slaid ya ria.",
