  "d.1v0q9n8": "Big",
  "d.1va9vvq": "Klaud ñan debri ya ko-orbit.",
  "d.1vw6p3e": "Karia ñan flit ibun hangar dek ae e stak ma e lait, pointi defens ae e dens ma reil taret.",
