  "d.1x5oilr": "Tyunin ñan develop (bust, spesing ñan roket, intaval ñan bei), skwadron stans, sain ROCKETS INCOMING ma sit ñan taret ya thad-pason.",
  "d.1x6m51e": "Vason 0.2.0 e fros: multiplea ya lokal netwok ma tri nyu map (LUNA, EARTH ORBIT, SOL).",
  "d.1xdakgt": "WARHOUND, pikcha ñan hangar ñan menyu ñan gem (hal ae e bildin ñan 0.3.0 ma ap; rit neitiv 256 x 128). Kaptscha ya gem, vason 0.6.1",
  "d.1xeup9p": "Eng laisens rivyu e tu oben: skan otomatik ñan similariti ñan eng kod ibun sors ñan eng GPL prototaip e wok ya {date0}, ma eng ekspet rivyu ñan matj ñan ea e tu ya progres.",
  "d.1xktp85": "KORVET ÑAN STRAIK",
  "d.1xw8628": "Eng BRAWLER ae e sho ya menyu ñan hangar ñan gem, hal ñan vason 0.6.1, vyu tri-kwota ya blak.",
  "d.1y1vl1m": "Hola ñan kontena ae e slo ma e amo. Fo taret ma tu PD maun e keep eng reida ya oben.",
  "d.1yawpsx": "MINIGAN",
  "d.1yg6jc4": "Eng mani ae e kam e yuze ñan hair yuman ota ma ekspand eng initiativ.",
  "d.1yq2qk7": "THETA-7 ASTEROID FIELD, pikcha ñan sekta ñan menyu ñan gem. Kaptscha ya gem, vason 0.6.1",
  "d.1ysusgc": "Bwai ae bwat ae e pei e keep fea ya yuman-ibun-yuman e tu ya dizain.",
  "d.21ryis": "Oda ñan ATTACK e tan ya wan tagit ma eng ae e ria mua.",
  "d.2pbr86": "Midiam",
  "d.2r8k8j": "WEDA",
  "d.2sqinp": "Tri bwat ibun plum ñan injin ya kil ñan Glasgow ae e hei, ae eng bwat ñan pailet ya mua e flai.",
  "d.2vomdh": "Skan otomatik ñan similariti ñan eng kod ñan gem ibun sors ñan eng GPL prototaip e wok ya {date0}. Eng ekspet rivyu ñan matj ñan ea e tu ya progres. Bwai ae e kam e kopi ke adapt e kam rirait.",
  "d.32ogvm": "Plum ñan injin ae e rit ñan nozol, ANVIL ae e 240 m ibun hangar ma dor ae e si-tru, NEEDLE skrambol ñan sai tu, ATTACK ae e tan ya wan ke tagit ae e ria mua, ma ANVIL AI ae e launch wing ñan ea.",
  "d.3b0pca": "EKSPLORA",
  "d.3bxw4p": "Mua raun ñan fand-reising ñan pablik.",
  "d.3ednu": "Rirait ae e ful ñan injin AI-BuB ñan Unreal Engine 5",
  "d.3m3q6c": "Hit ñan san, ma flea ya mineit ye ye.",
  "d.3wpyge": "Tin ma siks kilomita ñan siti ya Clyde ya skai ae e grei ma lo. Rial grabiti, rial er, rufop ma krein: keep spid ya hai ma nos ñan oe ya ria ñan eng riva.",
  "d.4b5t91": "PERIHELION, 4 SOLAR RADII, pikcha ñan sekta ñan menyu ñan gem. Kaptscha ya gem, vason 0.6.1",
  "d.4p55jj": "klas ñan bwat",
  "d.4pqks5": "Eng kod ñan gem e muv ñan BuB, wan nyu injin ae e rait ibun Claude Code. Eng gem modyul e kam ñan eng prototaip ma e renem bwil.",
  "d.4wz1ss": "Wan skrin LOADOUT mua matj ngaba (wan ple ma lobi ñan multiplea) ibun tia ñan hal ma sild, kala ñan sild, ro ñan hadpoin ma kraft ñan bei ñan ANVIL.",
  "d.5h9ajx": "LEIZA",
  "d.5zdnfb": "Vakyum: ta drag.",
  "d.61r5q7": "BEI ÑAN HANGAR IBUN 10 NEEDLE",
  "d.6mw8fz": "Bateri ñan taret ñan leiza ma gan ae e stat ya AUTO.",
  "d.6vf32z": "Vason 0 (demo) e fros: 8 klas ñan bwat, leiza ma salvo fair, eng THETA-7 asteroid fild.",
  "d.6wbq2y": "Eng disk ñan San, wan stil ñan eksplora ñan map.",
  "d.709qra": "Hol ñan chaj, relis ñan faiya. Relis ya 50 % chaj ke ota e faiya; ya lo e kansel.",
  "d.7a27ds": "Sit ñan hadpoin, voli ñan siks roket ibun kamera ae e folo, bust ae e dabol, leiza ripol ñan ANVIL, bei ñan ANVIL ae e launch 10 NEEDLE ae e fren, ma slaida ñan sek ñan kamera.",
  "d.7xvt5u": "Bwai ngaba e develop ibun AI ya eng injin BuB, ibun Claude Code.",
  "d.87vl1g": "Multiplea ya netwok lokal (find gem ya Wi-Fi ae e rit, host ke join wan lobi, launch ya tan; wev ko-op ma fri-fo-ol) ma tri map nyu: LUNA, EARTH ORBIT ma SOL.",
  "d.899luq": "Eng THRESHER ae e sho ya menyu ñan hangar ñan gem, hal ñan vason 0.6.1, vyu tri-kwota ya blak.",
  "d.90i5d3": "Weda.",
  "d.99x268": "Eng PATHFINDER ae e sho ya menyu ñan hangar ñan gem, hal ñan vason 0.6.1, vyu tri-kwota ya blak.",
  "d.9kqiam": "Eng matj e stat ya sai ñan ebon, ma sanrais ñan orbit e kam ya tri mineit.",
