  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Kwestyon",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Ta ñan nau. Multiplea LAN ya netwok ae e rit e wok ñan nau (ñan 0.2.0); ple onlain e ta bildin.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Eng prototaip e bildin ya eng open-sors injin ñan Quake III Arena (GPL) ma e tek bwat ñan Elite Dangerous ae inspireshon. Ya ran tu eng kod ñan gem e muv ñan BuB, wan nyu injin ae e rait ibun Claude Code; eng gem modyul e kam ñan eng prototaip ma e renem. Rilis 0.3.0 e gif hal nyu ñan klas ngaba ñan bwat, 16 ya ngaba. Laisens-komplains rivyu e chek ke wan ñan eng kod e tu derive ñan eng GPL orijinal ma ke eng ali bwat dizain e kloz ngaba ñan inspireshon. Skan otomatik ñan similariti ñan eng kod ibun sors ñan eng GPL prototaip e wok ya <0/>, ma eng ekspet rivyu ñan matj ñan ea e tu ya progres. Bwai ngaba ae e derive e kam rirait ke ridizain. Taim eng rivyu e ta dan, ngago e ta klem ibwa eng ansa e ta.",
  "faq.questions": "Kwestyon",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Bwat, art, intafeis ma ota, ke eng mani e let. <0>Eng ledja ya ñin peij<\/0> e lis elimen ngaba ma e kam sho wan wan ripleisment ma eng dizainar ñan ea.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Bwat ma apgred e planin ñan kam ean ya ple ke bai. Bwai ae bwat ae e pei e keep fea ya yuman-ibun-yuman e tu ya dizain.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Ñin eng plan: fri ñan ple ibun karensi ya gem ae e oksyonal ma kosmetik. E ta bildin ñan nau.",
