  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude ma Claude Code e treidmak ñan Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine ma Epic Games e treidmak ñan Epic Games, Inc. Blender e treidmak ñan Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena ma Elite Dangerous e treidmak ñan eng ona ñan ea. Nem ngaba e ñan eng ona ñan ea ma e yuze ye ñan idenifai eng prodakt ae e rifer. Orion-81 e ta afiliet, sponsa ke endorst ibun ea.",
