  "footer.notLiveYet": "E ta laiv ñan nau",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Wan aitem e tu oben: eng <0>laisens rivyu<\/0> ñan gem kod ae e kam ñan eng GPL prototaip. Skan otomatik ñan similariti ñan eng kod ibun sors ñan eng prototaip e wok ya <1/>, ma eng ekspet rivyu ñan matj ñan ea e tu ya progres.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 e projek ae e jenereit ibun AI ngaba.<\/0> Kod ñan Orion-81 ya ea ñan Claude Code, ae eng faunda e dairekt; bwat, map, tekschar ma saun e jenereit ibun tul ae Claude Code e rait. Open-sors laibrari ae e yuze e lis ya <1>'Ta meik ibun AI'<\/1>.",
